# Root-level internal working notes: session plans, raw chat transcripts, and
# patent-strategy drafts are scratch, not shared documentation. Keep them out of
# git history the same way .tasks/ is. Documentation that IS shared (README.md,
# DATAFLOW.md, AUDIT.md, INGEST.md, NEXT.md, PATENT*.md) is named, tracked, and
# deliberately not matched by these patterns.
/07_15.md
/ADD.md
/ANSWERS.md
/CONVO.md
/CONVO_*.md
/NOTES.md
/notes/
# Helm dependency artifacts — fetched by `helm dependency update .helm`
# (Harness passes --dependency-update); never vendored into git.
.helm/charts/
.helm/Chart.lock

